This sample is bound to the OpenAI chat-completions wire protocol — Azure OpenAI and vanilla OpenAI both work; non-OpenAI providers do not.

It works against multiple model backends (OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, and others) and scales from a single chat agent up to coordinated multi-agent workflows.

This works for one-shot interactions, but is insufficient for multi-turn conversations where users refer back to earlier context. 
